{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774095475459,"story":{"title":"Zella's Zoom to the Moon","userPrompt":"An adventure in space","authorStyleId":"julia-donaldson","readingLevel":"growing","illustrationStyleId":"storybook_classic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Young Zella, so bold, had a dream to unfold,\nA rocket of cardboard, a story untold.\nShe packed lunch of berries, and juice in a crate,\n\"To the moon!\" Zella cried, \"Before it gets late!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Zella, a girl with bright eyes and pigtails, stands proudly next to a cardboard rocket decorated with stars. She wears a homemade astronaut helmet. The background shows a whimsical garden with oversized flowers. Bright, warm colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095274357,"durationMs":6586,"retries":0,"promptLength":904,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 6-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with short golden blonde hair in short, slightly messy bob with a few stray strands, big-expressive bright green eyes with Excited, Determined expression, wearing A bright yellow t-shirt with a hand-drawn rocket ship on the front, blue denim overalls with star-shaped patches, and red and white striped socks., with A red bandana tied around her head, covering one ear., A smattering of freckles across her nose and cheeks, A gap between her two front teeth, A small birthmark shaped like a star on her left wrist, Rosy cheeks. Zella is packing a cardboard rocket in her backyard, filled with berries and juice. She looks excited and determined. in Zella's Backyard. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"She climbed in her craft, with a giggle and grin,\nPressed buttons of bottle caps, ready to spin.\nShe counted down loudly, \"Three, two, and ONE!\"\nHer rocket shook hard, the journey begun!","illustrationPrompt":"Zella inside her cardboard rocket, pushing bottle cap buttons with a determined expression. The rocket shakes slightly. The background shows a blurry view of the garden rushing past. Bright colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095274154,"durationMs":6379,"retries":0,"promptLength":915,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 6-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with short golden blonde hair in short, slightly messy bob with a few stray strands, big-expressive bright green eyes with Excited, Playful expression, wearing A bright yellow t-shirt with a hand-drawn rocket ship on the front, blue denim overalls with star-shaped patches, and red and white striped socks., with A red bandana tied around her head, covering one ear., A smattering of freckles across her nose and cheeks, A gap between her two front teeth, A small birthmark shaped like a star on her left wrist, Rosy cheeks. Zella is inside her rocket, pressing bottle cap buttons with a giggle, ready for launch. The rocket is shaking. in Zella's Backyard (inside the rocket). Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"Past clouds made of cotton, so fluffy and white,\nShe soared through the darkness, a glorious sight.\nShe saw twinkly stars, like bright diamond dust,\nAnd waved to a comet, in a rush, in a gust.","illustrationPrompt":"Zella's rocket flying through a starry night sky with cotton-like clouds. A friendly comet with a smiling face zooms past. Dark blue and purple background with bright stars. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095274530,"durationMs":6754,"retries":0,"promptLength":871,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 6-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with short golden blonde hair in short, slightly messy bob with a few stray strands, big-expressive bright green eyes with Amazed, Happy expression, wearing A bright yellow t-shirt with a hand-drawn rocket ship on the front, blue denim overalls with star-shaped patches, and red and white striped socks., with A red bandana tied around her head, covering one ear., A smattering of freckles across her nose and cheeks, A gap between her two front teeth, A small birthmark shaped like a star on her left wrist, Rosy cheeks. Zella's rocket is soaring past cotton-like clouds and twinkling stars. She's waving to a comet. in Outer Space. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"She spotted a planet, all wobbly and blue,\nWith creatures of jelly, quite see-through and new.\nThey wobbled and waved, with a friendly \"Hello!\"\nBut Zella kept going, \"The moon's where I'll go!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Zella's rocket approaching a blue, wobbly planet inhabited by friendly, transparent jelly creatures waving. The planet has rings made of candy. Bright, whimsical colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095279030,"durationMs":4874,"retries":0,"promptLength":1156,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 6-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with short golden blonde hair in short, slightly messy bob with a few stray strands, big-expressive bright green eyes with Focused, Determined expression, wearing A bright yellow t-shirt with a hand-drawn rocket ship on the front, blue denim overalls with star-shaped patches, and red and white striped socks., with A red bandana tied around her head, covering one ear., A smattering of freckles across her nose and cheeks, A gap between her two front teeth, A small birthmark shaped like a star on her left wrist, Rosy cheeks. A small translucent blue with shimmering silver speckles magical creature, big-expressive deep purple eyes with Friendly, Welcoming expression, Wobbly bodies, Antennae that glow faintly, No discernible limbs, Emit a soft, melodic humming sound, chubby build. Zella spots a wobbly blue planet with see-through jelly creatures waving hello. She's focused on going to the moon. in Outer Space. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Then suddenly, OH! A very strange sound,\nA Grumble-Bug buzzing, all cross and profound.\n\"You're too loud!\" it grumbled, \"Go back where you came!\"\nBut Zella stood firm, and spoke out its name.","illustrationPrompt":"Zella's rocket encountering a grumpy Grumble-Bug with large wings and antennae. Zella looks determined but not scared. Darker, muted colors for the Grumble-Bug to emphasize its grumpiness. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095311253,"durationMs":5529,"retries":0,"promptLength":1103,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 6-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with short golden blonde hair in short, slightly messy bob with a few stray strands, big-expressive bright green eyes with Surprised, Concerned expression, wearing A bright yellow t-shirt with a hand-drawn rocket ship on the front, blue denim overalls with star-shaped patches, and red and white striped socks., with A red bandana tied around her head, covering one ear., A smattering of freckles across her nose and cheeks, A gap between her two front teeth, A small birthmark shaped like a star on her left wrist, Rosy cheeks. A small dull green with brown stripes bug, small small black eyes with Angry, Grumpy expression, Large, buzzing wings, A frowning mouth, Two short antennae that twitch constantly, Six stubby legs, stocky build. A Grumble-Bug is buzzing angrily at Zella's rocket, telling her to go back. in Outer Space. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"\"Mr. Grumble-Bug, please, don't be so blue,\nI'm just on my way, dreams I must pursue.\nTo visit the moon, a brave thing to do,\nSo please let me pass, and I'll wave back to you!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Zella inside her rocket, speaking kindly to the Grumble-Bug. The Grumble-Bug looks slightly surprised. Soft, warm lighting on Zella's face. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095282587,"durationMs":8047,"retries":0,"promptLength":1093,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 6-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with short golden blonde hair in short, slightly messy bob with a few stray strands, big-expressive bright green eyes with Polite, Assertive expression, wearing A bright yellow t-shirt with a hand-drawn rocket ship on the front, blue denim overalls with star-shaped patches, and red and white striped socks., with A red bandana tied around her head, covering one ear., A smattering of freckles across her nose and cheeks, A gap between her two front teeth, A small birthmark shaped like a star on her left wrist, Rosy cheeks. A small dull green with brown stripes bug, small small black eyes with Annoyed, Skeptical expression, Large, buzzing wings, A frowning mouth, Two short antennae that twitch constantly, Six stubby legs, stocky build. Zella is politely but firmly addressing the Grumble-Bug, explaining her dream and asking to pass. in Outer Space. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"The Grumble-Bug paused, and blinked its small eyes,\n\"A brave little girl!\" it said with surprise.\n\"Perhaps I was hasty, a bit of a grump,\nGo on to the moon, have a wonderful jump!\"","illustrationPrompt":"The Grumble-Bug looking less grumpy, with a slightly softer expression. Zella smiles warmly. The rocket is in the background. Soft, warm colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095283612,"durationMs":4576,"retries":0,"promptLength":1103,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 6-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with short golden blonde hair in short, slightly messy bob with a few stray strands, big-expressive bright green eyes with Hopeful, Relieved expression, wearing A bright yellow t-shirt with a hand-drawn rocket ship on the front, blue denim overalls with star-shaped patches, and red and white striped socks., with A red bandana tied around her head, covering one ear., A smattering of freckles across her nose and cheeks, A gap between her two front teeth, A small birthmark shaped like a star on her left wrist, Rosy cheeks. A small dull green with brown stripes bug, small small black eyes with Surprised, Approving expression, Large, buzzing wings, A frowning mouth, Two short antennae that twitch constantly, Six stubby legs, stocky build. The Grumble-Bug is blinking in surprise, realizing Zella is brave, and giving her permission to continue. in Outer Space. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"At last, the moon shimmered, so creamy and bright,\nZella landed her rocket, with all of her might.\nShe planted a flag, made of fabric so grand,\nA small piece of Earth, in this faraway land.","illustrationPrompt":"Zella standing on the moon, which is a soft, creamy color. She's planting a flag made of colorful fabric scraps. The cardboard rocket is nearby. The Earth is visible in the distance. Soft, dreamy colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095287007,"durationMs":5944,"retries":0,"promptLength":856,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 6-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with short golden blonde hair in short, slightly messy bob with a few stray strands, big-expressive bright green eyes with Proud, Accomplished expression, wearing A bright yellow t-shirt with a hand-drawn rocket ship on the front, blue denim overalls with star-shaped patches, and red and white striped socks., with A red bandana tied around her head, covering one ear., A smattering of freckles across her nose and cheeks, A gap between her two front teeth, A small birthmark shaped like a star on her left wrist, Rosy cheeks. Zella has landed her rocket on the moon and is planting a flag. in Outer Space (The Moon). Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"She ate all her berries, and drank up her juice,\nThen waved to the Earth, \"What a wonderful cruise!\"\nShe flew back so swiftly, with stars in her hair,\nA brave little girl, beyond all compare.","illustrationPrompt":"Zella flying her rocket back towards Earth, with stardust shimmering in her hair. She's waving goodbye to the moon. The Earth is getting closer. Bright, cheerful colors. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774095288456,"durationMs":5863,"retries":0,"promptLength":887,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed a